==History==
2020
*The Heal Spirit [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 2/4/2020, in a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(2/4/2020)|maintenance break]], replacing the [[Heal]].
*On 31/8/2020, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20II%20Update%20(31/8/2020)|Clan Wars II Update]], added the Damage, Healing, Range and Targets statistics on the Heal Spirit's card info screen. It also made it so that [[Clone|cloned]] [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] can no longer be healed by the Heal Spirit.
*On 9/9/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/9/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Heal Spirit's healing radius to 3.5 tiles (from 4 tiles).
*On 6/10/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Heal Spirit's healing effect by 9%.
*On 9/12/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/12/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Heal Spirit's damage by 69%.
2021
*On 30/3/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%201%20Update%20(30/3/2021)|2021 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Heal Spirit's damage by 225%, but decreased its healing radius to 2.5 tiles (from 3.5 tiles).
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Heal Spirit from Hog Mountain to Rascal's Hideout and fixed an issue where the Heal Spirit was considered a [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]] card in its info menu.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 30/3/2022, the [[Version History#Miner%20Update%20(30/3/2022)|Miner Update]], fixed an issue where the Heal Spirit's [[Star Points|Star Level]] used the sound effects of the [[Ice Spirit]].
*On 12/12/2022, the [[Version History#Clashmas%20Update%20(12/12/2022)|Clashmas Update]], made it so that the Heal Spirit's projectile can no longer be deflected.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Heal Spirit's hitpoints by 0.43%, and increased its healing by 0.25%.
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Heal Spirit's hitpoints by 6%

